            "Hello, everyone. Imagine going to school without a car or a bus. My topic is cycling. First of all, it is cheap and good for your health, and it is easy to start. In conclusion, a bike is simple, useful and fun. Thank you for your attention. Any questions? Is it expensive? Thank you for your question. In short, no: a bike costs less than the bus. And if it rains? I am not sure, but I will find out and tell you later. I did not understand the price. What I mean is that it is cheaper than a bus ticket."
          ]
